hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15825","Yahya narrated to us: Hisham narrated to us, and Ibn Numayr said: Hisham narrated to us, he said: My father informed me, from Hajjaj ibn Hajjaj, from his father, he said: I said: O Messenger of Allah, what removes from me the blame of fosterage? He said: A white spot, a male slave or a female slave."
"15826","He said: Abd al-Rahman narrated to us, from Sufyan, and Ishaq, from Sufyan, Sufyan said, from Abd al-Karim al-Jazari, from Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Amrah, from his uncle, that the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: Do not combine my name and my kunyah."
